    {
      "id": "claim_5e0a7639123d4f61b93de1f14c8def7f",
      "statement": "Bookmark in core is a plain @dataclass (id, url, title, tags, created_at), not a Pydantic model. The API layer wraps it in Pydantic schemas (BookmarkIn/BookmarkOut/TagCount) for validation/serialization, keeping core free of web-framework dependencies.",
