    {
      "id": "claim_f37f9a931eb04014a2eb5d7c9f96acd3",
      "statement": "Import dedups by normalized URL (normalize_url strips whitespace and a single trailing slash, lowercases the entire URL). Existing bookmarks win: incoming duplicates are silently dropped with no field merge, and dedup also removes duplicates within the incoming batch. Fresh bookmarks get reassigned sequential IDs (imported IDs discarded) continuing from store.next_id(existing).",
